OL,3,GNEWSADrinking water pollution fears
OL,4,Aover gas drilling plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners claim an energy firm's
OL,7,Fplans to drill through an ancient chalk
OL,8,Faquifer in its search for gas risks
OL,9,Fpolluting clean water supplies relied
OL,10,Fon by large parts of Yorkshire.
OL,12,FEgdon, a UK-based oil and gas firm,
OL,13,Fsaid the aquifer, known as the
OL,14,FFlamborough Chalk, would be screened
OL,15,Foff during the first drilling stage
OL,16,Fwhen it is at greatest risk.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
