OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADrinking water pollution fears
OL,4,Aover gas drilling plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Laura Bell, from campaign group
OL,7,FDrawing a Line in the Chalk, said:
OL,8,F"Egdon are relying on the chances of
OL,9,Fsomething happening being so small.
OL,10,FThere isn't an explanation of what
OL,11,Fwould happen if it did go wrong."
OL,13,FYorkshire Water said: "The chalk
OL,14,Faquifer is highly vulnerable to
OL,15,Fpollution from activities at the
OL,16,Fsurface at this location."
